[I] Authorization Toolkit

[T] PolicyKit is a toolkit for defining and handling authorizations. It is
[T] used for allowing unprivileged processes to speak to privileged
[T] processes.

[U] http://gitweb.freedesktop.org/?p=PolicyKit.git;a=summary

[A] David Zeuthen <davidz@redhat.com>
[M] Aldas Nabazas <baldzius@gmail.com>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[E] opt consolekit

